Z||000004||3.8T Fiero GT||10-24-2001||02:17 PM||||Thanks guys.  Wow, Fieros in the Netherlands?? Never woulda thought!<P>Well I have almost everything, almost nothing installed yet.  Have motor, 5spd tranny, KKK T3/T4 hybrid turbo, external wastegate, 11.25" vented disc bigbrake kit, all around, poly-urethane bushings for all around including cradle, susp. techinques springs, sway bars, (shocks maybe, stocks are fine), SDS aftermarket fuel system, 2 new red sparcos, and custom body panels.  I still need custom exhaust made, manifold, and intercooler piping when the motor goes in, hope all goes well!  I go to Joe at Racetech automotive in Toronto for parts for those of u who know him.  My buddy and I are doing the swap, hes a GM freak!  It helps!<P>I am hoping for low 12's...u guys think its possible?!  Going by my math, (and my driving, heh), the size of the turbo (ex-porsche) and the 3.8 motor it should be possible, no???  Perhaps sub 13's easy???<P>The motor's bottom end is 3800 series I supercharged, chucked the supercharger, got a 3800 series I naturally aspirited intake on, then the turbo will be fit with 14 row starion intercooler, dual cooling fans and piping   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Rice killer ready for serving  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>**SIDENOTE**<BR>ZR-1 ChopTop, your car looks friggin AWESOME!!!!!  I have seen it b4 on the net.<P>"Jay"-I didnt know u were here?  Hows the car. U sell it yet? Benn at racetech lately??<BR><p>[This message has been edited by 3.8T Fiero GT (edited 10-24-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000005||72vinman||10-24-2001||03:07 PM||||Hey 3.8T Fiero GT, Welcome to the forum. There are actually quite a few of Toronto guys on here. there is already one post going on all Canadians as well as a post trying to get a bunch of Ontario guys together this weekend.<BR>I have been thinking about doing the 3.8 to my 86GT. Would love to see what you guys have in mind. Maybe I could pay you to do mine as well  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Talk to ya<BR>||||reg||1
